        "created_at": "2026-06-26T21:15:19.220Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is is still possible to order a replacement of any card? I ordered Sentinels of the Multiverse: Oblivaeon I got stuck with printing error where I got 3 copies of Harpy’s character card. I tried to email <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a> last month, but I haven’t heard anything from them. I think that email doesn’t work anymore. Does anyone have any solutions?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance,</p>",
