        "created_at": "2026-06-27T00:02:46.192Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That appears to be outdated.  There have been developments, and the current GTG site is over here:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthan.games/\">https://greaterthan.games/</a></p>\n<p>And their current contact form page url appears to be:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthan.games/pages/contact\">https://greaterthan.games/pages/contact</a></p>\n<p>Note the lack of a dot com, which has been replaced by dot games.</p>\n<p>This forum is kind of a legacy at this point, and I’m uncertain who’s actually running it.  If it’s Flat River Group, it might disappear any moment.  If it’s the new GTG, it certainly is a bit confusing.</p>",
