        "raw": "That appears to be outdated.  There have been developments, and the current GTG site is over here:\n\n[https://greaterthan.games/](https://greaterthan.games/)\n\nAnd their current contact form page url appears to be:\n\n[https://greaterthan.games/pages/contact](https://greaterthan.games/pages/contact)\n\nNote the lack of a dot com, which has been replaced by dot games.\n\nThis forum is kind of a legacy at this point, and I'm uncertain who's actually running it.  If it's Flat River Group, it might disappear any moment.  If it's the new GTG, it certainly is a bit confusing.",
